id: CTB-SRC0009-C-1
source: SRC-0009
section: §2.8,§2.9,§2.10,§2.12,§2.13,§7.1
kind: requirement
scope: ARC
title: Architectural invariants of every capability
applied-in: STG-00 #1
distinct-from: LXM-REQ-000196
text: All capabilities must conform to automated conformance and invariant enforcement; dependency and impact analysis; deterministic and recoverable changes; zero unjustified duplication, overlap, ambiguity, orphan artifacts and conflicting authorities; and security, privacy, resilience and scalability by architectural design. The architecture must continuously maintain its own integrity through machine-verifiable contracts, controlled mutation, automatic dependency propagation, version management, migration governance, regression testing and conformance evidence.
